 "description": "Open the menu. Scan it. Know what to order in about 10 seconds.\n\nMENU ORDER AI reads any restaurant menu: printed, delivery app, or a photo on your phone. It ranks every dish for the way you eat right now. High-protein, lower-carb, plant-based, portion-friendly. No logging. No searching a database. Just your best options, at the top, before the server comes back.\n\nWHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT\n\nSmart Tweaks\nMost apps tell you what NOT to order. We tell you how to make the dish you actually want work: skip the bun, swap the side, order the lunch portion, ask for the sauce on the side. Small changes, same meal out.\n\nThe GSR Score\nEvery dish gets a GLP-1 Satisfaction Ratio, our score for how well a meal holds you, built on protein density, fiber and portion size, not calories alone. A 400-calorie plate that leaves you hungry in an hour is not a win. GSR is how we tell the difference.\n\nBuilt for smaller appetites\nProtein-forward, fiber-rich, right-sized. If you're eating less than you used to, for any reason, the app is tuned for you, not for a bulking gym log.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Tell us one thing: what matters most right now (protein, lower carb, plant-based, portion size).\n2. Scan the menu, search the restaurant, or paste a delivery screenshot.\n3. See your top picks, ranked, with a full nutrition estimate and the Smart Tweaks for each one.\n4. Order. Save the ones that worked so ordering is instant next time.\n\nWHERE IT WORKS\n\nSit-down restaurants, fast casual, drive-thru, delivery apps, hotel menus, airport terminals, and the local place with a one-page laminated menu.\n\nFREE TO START\n\nScan menus free, without creating an account. Upgrade for unlimited scans, saved favorites, and every filter.\n\nWHO IT'S FOR\n\n\u2022 Anyone eating out with a smaller appetite and a protein target\n\u2022 People who want the high-protein pick without reading 60 items\n\u2022 Anyone tired of \"just get the salad\" being the only advice they get\n\nKnow what to order. Order with confidence.\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.menuorderai.com/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.menuorderai.com/privacy-policy/",
